+//  2. the page's data, where a site names each video with its picture size ("video_versions");
+//  3. the files the page itself fetched (Resource Timing, and the list BareMediaMenuGuard keeps,
+//     which goes on after the page's own record of 250 fetches is full). Picture-only and
+//     sound-only files are told apart, and their picture size and length read, from the first bytes of each file, so the
